    "description": {
      "unidentified": "<h3>Statistics</h3><p><b>Damage</b> 1d6 (small), 1d8 (medium); <b>Critical</b> 20/x2; <b>Type</b> Slashing</p><h3>Description</h3>\n<h3>Power Pole</h3>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 200 gil</p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 (small), 1d6 (medium)</p><p><strong>Critical:</strong> x2</p><p><strong>Weight:</strong> 8 lbs.</p><p><strong>Type:</strong> Elemental</p><p><strong>Special:</strong> Finesse, reach, see text</p><p>Power Weapons are built for mages or anyone with an MP pool and a caster level. It requires an MP pool and caster level to use, even with Exotic Weapon Proficiency. They are supernatural and do not function within anti-magic fields. Instead of Strength or Dexterity, Power Weapons deal extra elemental damage equal to the wielder's casting modifier, capped by caster level.</p><p>Melee Power Weapons can only attack adjacent targets with a reach of 5 feet and use melee touch attacks, and do not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>"
